    "%@ 需要文本改写大模型才能运行。没配置模型时，听写仍可用（自动退回语音原文上屏）；要使用翻译、改写、地道外文或任意提问，请先在设置里配置一个文本模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ needs a text-rewrite model to run. Without one, Dictation still works (it inserts the raw transcript). To use Translation, Rewrite, Idiomatic Rewrite, or Ask Anything, configure a text model in Settings first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
