    "PaddleOCR v6 Small 在本机识别截图区域，不上传图片。下载约 31MB；未安装时会回落到 Apple Vision。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PaddleOCR v6 Small recognizes the captured area on-device without uploading the image. ~31MB download; falls back to Apple Vision when not installed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PaddleOCR 使用本地 ONNX 模型识别截图区域。当前版本优先覆盖网页、PDF 和普通水平排版截图；旋转、弯曲文字或复杂表格仍可切回 Apple Vision / 云端 OCR。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PaddleOCR uses a local ONNX model to recognize screenshot regions. This version works best with web pages, PDFs, and standard horizontal layouts. For rotated, curved text, or complex tables, switch back to Apple Vision / Cloud OCR."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Responsay": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responsay"
          }
        }
      },
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Responsay 从你的纠正里学到的词，全部存在本机。可逐条撤销；或点右上「清空」一次清掉全部学习记录与自动学到的词条（手动添加的词不受影响）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words Responsay learned from your corrections, all stored on-device. Revert them one by one, or tap “Clear” at the top right to wipe the entire learning record and every auto-learned term at once (manually added words are unaffected)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Responsay 正在处理上一条内容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
