    "✦ 回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✦ Answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「上屏」指把生成结果写进当前光标处的输入框，整段一次性插入；以上两项只决定插入完成后剪贴板里留什么。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Insert” means writing the result into the input field at your cursor, all at once; the two options above only decide what stays on the clipboard after insertion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「写入并讲解」在写入的同时显示讲解卡片（红绿对照、为什么这样说、别的说法）；「仅讲解」只显示讲解卡片，读后再手动写入；两种的讲解内容一致。只想把地道外文直接写进光标、不看讲解，用「听写翻译」（Fn+Shift）即可——它按你的意图直接译成地道外文写入，不弹讲解卡。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Insert & Explain\" inserts the text and shows an explanation card (before/after, why it works, alternatives). \"Explain only\" shows the card without inserting — you insert manually afterward. Both modes produce the same explanation. If you just want idiomatic text inserted at the cursor without any explanation, use Voice Translation (Fn+Shift) — it translates and inserts directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「如实输入 / 意图成稿」是听写默认，二选一（和菜单栏「如实输入」联动）。装好后默认意图成稿：补标点、去口癖、删掉你改口被推翻的话，按你的意图把话理顺，口述的清单还会自动分点——读起来像你认真打的字（但不会替你编事实、加称呼署名或拔高确定性）。如果不认同我们的整理，切到「如实输入」，就只用语音识别原文、不过大模型。「表达升级」力度最大——选中一段文字用「改写选中文本」整段重写，跟着选区走，不是听写默认，所以不参与上面的二选一。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Verbatim / Smart Cleanup\" is the dictation default — pick one (synced with the menu bar \"Verbatim\" toggle). Smart Cleanup is on by default: it adds punctuation, removes filler words, drops self-corrections, and tidies your phrasing — spoken lists get bullet points automatically. It reads like carefully typed text (without inventing facts, adding salutations, or inflating certainty). If you prefer the raw transcript, switch to Verbatim. \"Expression Upgrade\" is the most powerful mode — it rewrites an entire selected passage via \"Rewrite Selected Text\" and is not the dictation default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「朗读」由「朗读选中文本」快捷键 / 菜单或地道外文卡片上的 🔊 触发；「跟读」是放慢语速跟着范读练习。范读音色取自上面选择的朗读引擎，放慢语速有助于捕捉连读与重音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Read Aloud\" is triggered by the \"Read Selected Text\" shortcut / menu or the 🔊 button on an Idiomatic Rewrite card. \"Follow-along\" slows the pace for shadowing practice. The voice used comes from the TTS engine you selected above; slowing down helps you catch connected speech and stress."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「自动」= 优先用你当前的文本模型（若它本就支持联网），否则用第一个你已配好密钥的联网模型。这三家都没配密钥时会自动退回普通问答——去「文本改写」给对应模型填好密钥即可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Auto\" = use your current text model if it supports web search; otherwise use the first online model you have a key for. If none of the three are configured, it falls back to standard Q&A — go to \"Text Rewrite\" to add a key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「重新学习」在后台用模型重提炼一次（需要已配好文本模型、且攒够几条听写），完成后这里会刷新。手动覆盖优先于学到的；想关就关掉上面的开关。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Relearn\" re-distills your style in the background (requires a configured text model and enough dictation history). This view refreshes when done. Manual edits take priority over learned style; toggle the switch above to disable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键打开核验（百度学术 + 北大法宝）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Verify (Baidu Scholar + PKU LawInfo)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键联网核验全部": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verify All Online"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "万方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wanfang"
          }
