      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不在列表里也行：直接输入该服务支持的任意模型 ID 即可调用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not in the list? Type any model ID the provider supports."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不填词表时自动注入应用内「识别词典」做热词纠偏；填了词表则以控制台词表为准（官方限制：单次识别只生效一种）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without a vocabulary ID, the app's Dictionary is injected automatically for hotword correction. If you supply a vocabulary ID, the provider's list takes precedence (limitation: only one list can apply per recognition session)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不对，手动查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not right — check manually"
          }
        }
      }
