    "中文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chinese"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中维护，对所有支持的引擎生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "and applies to all supported engines."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为安全起见，未经核验的法条 / 案例引用始终标注 [待核]；%@不编造法条号或案号，交由你核实。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For safety, unverified statute / case references are always marked [Unverified]. %@ does not fabricate article numbers or case numbers — you verify them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为每个触发键挑选它启动的动作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the action each trigger key launches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为语音识别引擎配置密钥、端点、模型与离线模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
