      }
    },
    "仅保存在本机数据库中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stored only in the on-device database."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天与最近 7 天的听写概览 · 全部本机统计": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today and last 7 days of dictation · all local stats"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍需打开原文人工确认，不自动判定真伪。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You still need to open the source and verify manually — authenticity is not determined automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从 *.LEGAL_SKILL.md 导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import from *.LEGAL_SKILL.md"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从你保留的听写里学一句你的风格，喂给「意图成稿」，让它整理得更像你写的。可手改或关掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learns your style from dictations you keep and feeds it to “Smart Cleanup” so results read more like your own writing. Editable, or can be turned off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从你的纠正里学到的：普通词静默加入，专业词先问你再生效。全部在本机，可随时批准、拒绝或撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learned from your corrections: common words are added silently; technical terms ask you first. Everything stays on-device — approve, reject, or undo at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从公开目录浏览并安装社区法律技能（只读）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browse and install community legal skills from the public directory (read-only)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从内存卸载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unload from Memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从剪贴板粘贴 API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste API Key from Clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从目录安装第三方技能": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install third-party skills from directory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从轻到重三档。默认「意图成稿」：补标点、去口癖、删改口，按你的意图把话理顺、口述清单自动分点；想只用语音原文不过大模型，切到「如实输入」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three levels, light to heavy. Default “Smart Cleanup”: adds punctuation, removes filler words and false starts, smooths the text to your intent, and auto-bullets spoken lists. To keep the raw speech without an LLM, switch to “Verbatim”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任意提问": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Anything"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除学习日志和所有自动学到的词条；手动添加的词不受影响。此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes the learning log and every auto-learned term; manually added words are unaffected. This action cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体验": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try It"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你可以为它绑定全局快捷键（下一步），随时按下，框选屏幕即可取词。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can assign a global shortcut (next step) — press it anytime and draw a region to extract text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的数据去哪儿了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where Your Data Goes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的表达风格": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Writing Style"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你纠正学到的词只存在这台 Mac（识别词典，随时可删），不传任何服务器。法言本机优先：没配 API key 时，听写、改写走 Apple 系统或离线模型，全程不出本机；只有你自己配了某家云服务商的 Key，对应的语音 / 文字才会直接发给你选的那一家——你的密钥、没有中间服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words learned from your corrections are stored only on this Mac (in the Dictionary — deletable anytime) and are never sent to any server. Responsay is local-first: with no API key, dictation and rewriting use Apple system or offline models, fully on-device. Only when you configure a cloud provider's key does the corresponding audio or text go directly to that provider — your key, no middleman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你说的：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You said:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
