      }
    },
    "听写历史": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictation History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "听写历史只存在本机，可随时清理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictation history stays on-device and can be cleared anytime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "听写完成后，如果你教过的某个术语被听成了音近的别字，可以让你配置的 AI 再校一遍——只动这些术语，别的字一个都不改。默认关闭：开着、且配好了改写 LLM（自带云端 Key）、且这句话里确实还有音近误识时，才会把已在本机纠过一遍的这句话发给你配的云端模型；关着就完全不出本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After dictation, if a term you've taught was mistranscribed as a homophone, your configured AI can do a targeted correction pass — only those terms are changed, nothing else. Off by default: when on, and you have a rewrite LLM with a cloud key, and there really is a homophone error in the transcript, the locally corrected text is sent to your cloud model. When off, nothing leaves the device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "听写延迟  p50 %lldms · p95 %lldms · n=%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictation latency  p50 %lldms · p95 %lldms · n=%lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "听写延迟  p50 %1$lldms · p95 %2$lldms · n=%3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动即最小化": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start minimized"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动时不显示主窗口，仅在菜单栏待命。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't show the main window on launch; stay ready in the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启用辅助功能权限后，会读取目标 App、窗口标题、光标附近文本和选中文本，用于本机的上下文判断与热词偏置（不上传）。另：「技能偏好 → 屏幕上下文」开启时（默认开），地道外文与任意提问会把当前应用、窗口标题和屏幕可见文字随提问发给你配置的云端 AI；密码框等敏感场景始终跳过，可在该处随时关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Accessibility permission enabled, Responsay reads the active app, window title, text near the cursor, and selected text for on-device context and hotword biasing (never uploaded). Additionally: when \"Skill Preferences → Screen Context\" is on (default), Idiomatic Rewrite and Ask Anything send the current app, window title, and visible screen text to your cloud AI along with the query. Sensitive inputs (password fields, etc.) are always skipped; you can disable this at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "命中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "四类模型各选一路。本机引擎无需密钥；云端模型按需在「配置」里填你的密钥（存本机钥匙串）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick one option for each of the four model types. On-device engines need no key; for cloud models, enter your key under “Configure” as needed (stored in the on-device Keychain)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "四类模型各选一路：语音识别 / 文本改写 / 文本朗读 / 图片识别。": {
