    "开 · 模型先思考再作答（更慢、更细）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On · Model thinks before answering (slower, more thorough)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后会用你配置的文本模型，偶尔把你近期保留的听写提炼成一句风格描述，叠进意图成稿（默认开）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, uses your configured text model to occasionally distill your recent kept dictations into a one-line style description, layered into Smart Cleanup (on by default)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后如果仍无法截图，再重启 Responsay。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " If capture still fails afterward, restart Responsay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，Responsay 会从你纠正刚写入文本的动作中学习候选词。关闭后停止学习新热词，只使用手动词、内置词和已保留的自动词。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, Responsay learns candidate words from how you correct text it just inserted. When off, it stops learning new hotwords and uses only manual, built-in, and retained auto words."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，地道外文和任意提问会把当前应用、窗口标题与屏幕可见文字随提问发给你配置的云端 AI（用你自己的 key）；密码框等敏感场景自动跳过。关闭后不再发送任何屏幕内容，本机热词与技能路由不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, Idiomatic Rewrite and Ask Anything send the current app, window title, and visible screen text to your cloud AI along with each query (using your own key). Sensitive inputs are skipped automatically. Disabling this stops all screen content from being sent; on-device hotwords and skill routing are unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，截图取字后直接写入剪贴板，不弹出可编辑结果面板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, recognized text from a screenshot is written straight to the clipboard without showing the editable result panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
