          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图翻译要译成哪种语言；截图取字后是直接复制还是弹出可编辑面板；截图复制把图片本身放进剪贴板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which language Screenshot Translate translates into; whether Screenshot Text copies directly or opens an editable panel; Screenshot Copy puts the image itself on the clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所以走云端时，你的内容会交给你选的那家供应商处理；它怎么保存、怎么使用这些数据，要看这家供应商自己的隐私政策。在意隐私的内容，建议优先用本地模型——不上传、也不离开这台电脑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When using a cloud provider, your content is processed by that provider. How they store and use it is governed by their own privacy policy. For privacy-sensitive content, use local models — nothing is uploaded or leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
