    "每个功能一行。点「录制」后按下即可：Fn + 字母数字、右 Option + 字母数字，或带 ⌘/⌃ 且至少两个修饰键的组合 + 字母数字（如 ⌘⇧S、⌘⌥K、Hyper）。其他组合不收。Fn 默认已配好，录制是再加一个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One row per feature. Click “Record”, then press: Fn + letter/number, right Option + letter/number, or a combo with ⌘/⌃ and at least two modifiers + letter/number (e.g. ⌘⇧S, ⌘⌥K, Hyper). Other combos are rejected. Fn is preconfigured; recording adds another."
          }
        }
      }
    },
