    "法言如何启动、录音与上屏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How Responsay launches, records, and inserts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "法言没有自己的服务器。你的语音、识别出的文字、改写结果，要么只留在这台电脑上（用本地模型时），要么直接发给你自己配置的云端模型供应商（用你填的 API Key），中间不经过我们的任何服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responsay has no servers of its own. Your audio, transcribed text, and rewritten output either stay on this Mac (with local models) or go directly to the cloud provider you configured (using your own API key) — no intermediary servers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
