    "离线「如实」听写本身不带标点；装上它就在本机给中英文补标点，零联网、零 LLM。下载即用，下方各离线识别模型都会用到它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offline “Verbatim” dictation carries no punctuation on its own; install this to add punctuation to Chinese and English on-device, with no network and no LLM. Ready to use once downloaded; every offline recognition model below uses it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
