    "第一语言是你的母语，第二语言是你最常用的外语。听写翻译、划词翻译把母语译成外语；截图翻译「自动」则把外文译成母语。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first language is your native tongue; your second is the foreign language you use most. Dictation Translate and Selection Translate render your native language into the foreign one; Screenshot Translate “Auto” renders the foreign language into your native one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一语言（母语）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First language (native)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第三方技能是别人写的提示词，可能给出不准确的法律分析。导入后默认关闭；启用后未核验的法条/案号仍会标 [待核]，发送范围仍由隐私门把关。请只导入你信任来源的技能。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Third-party skills are prompts written by others and may provide inaccurate legal analysis. Disabled by default after import. When enabled, unverified statutes/case numbers are still marked [Unverified] and data scope is governed by the privacy gate. Only import skills from sources you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第二语言（外语）": {
