    "纯原生支持、断网可用。一般占用空间越大、效果越好，可自行比对；这几个离线模型目前尚未经过充分测试，仅为可用级别。如需更改模型下载位置，请前往左侧「离线模型下载与管理」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fully native, works offline. Larger models are generally more accurate — compare for yourself; these offline models aren't fully tested yet and are usable-grade only. To change the model download location, go to “Offline Model Download & Management” on the left."
          }
        }
