          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一档只管「地道外文」——把话转成外语时老实按你说的意思来、还是你说乱时替你重构意图，跟上面听写的「如实 / 意图成稿」是两条线。「原意优先」只换说法、不改你的意思；「猜测意图」在你说乱、说反时，替你把最想表达的那件事理顺，再用母语者的口吻说出来（讲解里会告诉你它怎么理解你的）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This setting only affects Idiomatic Rewrite — whether it follows exactly what you said or reconstructs your intent when your wording is confused. It's a separate axis from dictation's \"Verbatim / Smart Cleanup.\" \"Preserve intent\" only changes phrasing without altering meaning. \"Infer intent\" restructures when your wording is unclear or inverted, expressing what you most likely meant in native-speaker phrasing (the explanation card shows how it interpreted you)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些设置随时可在\n偏好设置里修改。": {
