    "默认「自动」：外文截图译成你的母语，母语截图译成外语（母语 / 外语在「翻译语言」设置里）。也可在此固定成中文 / 英语 / 德语 / 日语。两者的快捷键可在「快捷键」设置里自定义。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default \"Auto\": foreign-language screenshots translate to your native language; native-language screenshots translate to your target language (configure languages in \"Translation Language\" settings). You can also fix it to Chinese / English / German / Japanese. Shortcuts for both can be customized in the Shortcuts settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
